Description: Five-year risk of lung cancer death without CT screening for
    ever-smokers, with competing mortality, from the Lung Cancer Death Risk
    Assessment Tool (LCDRAT; Katki et al., JAMA 2016
    <doi:10.1001/jama.2016.6255>). Uses the code and fitted models of NCI's
    lcmodels R package, version 4.1.3, unchanged. Not intended for treating or
    diagnosing human subjects.
